          <attvalue for="35" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="An increase in the geopolitical market risk premium causes global asset managers and cross‑border investors to de‑risk and reduce allocations to duration- and credit-sensitive bonds and emerging-market assets, producing net outflows from bond markets." />
