          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="War‑related disruptions to suppliers of drilling equipment, spare parts and specialized services degrade maintenance and expansion schedules, directly reducing installed and operable oil extraction and processing capacity over the following months." />
