          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Higher long-term yields increase discount rates and the effective cost of financing capital-intensive AI projects (data centers, GPUs), prompting institutional and venture investors to scale back or reprice commitments to AI infrastructure and R&amp;D." />
