          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Higher sovereign borrowing costs raise public debt service and reduce governments' fiscal headroom for co‑financing or guaranteeing oil projects, leading to slower or smaller investor capital commitments into those assets." />
