          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A rise in sovereign borrowing costs immediately tightens government budgetary space and raises the fiscal price of long-term commitments, prompting governments supporting the Ukraine war to defer, downscale or cancel new defense contracts and thus reduce the procurement rate." />
