          <attvalue for="35" value="0.75" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Escalating international legal disputes or sanction risk raises counterparty, enforceability and payout uncertainties for creditors, causing lenders to demand higher yields on sovereign issuance and widening borrowing spreads." />
